data: {"id": "a91dc371a58b4d58-thinking-parallel_evidence-941", "run_id": "a91dc371a58b4d58", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 证据结论 (Evidence Conclusion)\n\n#### 1. 已确认事实 (Supporting Facts)\n*   **Pod 生命周期状态**: 目标 Pod `workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` 在命名空间 `aiops-case-05` 中，调度至 `node2`。其状态确认为 `Pending`，容器状态为 `ContainerCreating`，重启次数为 0。\n*   **直接异常原因 (Events/Describe)**: 容器无法创建沙箱 (FailedCreatePodSandBox)。根本原因是 **CNI (Multus) 网络配置失败**，具体报错为 `NoNetworkFound`——Pod 试图引用一个名为 `unavailable-network` 的 `network-attachment-definition`，但该定义在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中不存在。\n*   **Pod 配置 (YAML)**: 验证了 Pod 的 `annotations` 中包含 `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.i", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789059469477, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "a91dc371a58b4d58-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "a91dc371a58b4d58", "seq": 942, "ts_ms": 1789059478585, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 53.294, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-05", "name": "workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/a91dc371a58b4d58-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "7012533db969dee02b65862d710cf8564c1b90a941173ca78232416929d3ecab", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "93bcdec7cb8e54bafc2b9d5568363582982a107a4bb4fb33331b9a2c9d196873"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

